prepare-exposure|python3|scripts/cluster/prepare-exposure-namespaces.py|노출 YAML이 참조하는 Namespace를 먼저 plan/apply
install-local-path-storage|bash|scripts/cluster/install-local-path-storage.sh|StorageClass 부재 시 local-path provisioner 설치
