install-platform|bash|scripts/cluster/install-testbed-platform.sh|인증서/1+N 노드/OpenBao/ESO/Reloader
configure-openbao-app-access|bash|scripts/ops/configure-openbao-app-access.sh|앱별 OpenBao OIDC 권한 구성(관리자 전용)
configure-openbao-oidc|bash|scripts/ops/configure-openbao-oidc.sh|Gateway/TLS/discovery preflight 뒤 OpenBao OIDC 설정 멱등 수렴
