verify-portal-auth|bash|scripts/verify/verify-portal-auth.sh|Auth.js -> 외부 OIDC 인증 흐름
verify-squid|bash|scripts/verify/verify-squid-egress.sh|렌더된 allowlist 검증(host 변경 없음)
